    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kemitu Olaitoriani Yerusalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woi ninche lelo oodoyio aapuo Misiri aaing'oru eretoto, neisilig mbartan, lelo oong'idare ngarrin oo mbartan eji amu aikumok, o lelo akedok loo mbartan eji amu kegol ninche oleng, kake meing'orninche Ilo Sinyati le Israel, aashu eikilikuanishore ninye! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ng'en ake sii ninye neyau enkidaata, merrinyokino ninye irorei lenyena, kake kedumakino ninye ina aji oo larruok, nedumakino lelo aretok le lelo oas entorroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo le Misiri naa iltung'ana, mme Enkai; ore nena bartan enye naa nkiri, mme nkiyang'eta. Te neitorioo Olaitoriani enkaina enye, neikirikira ilo oretisho, ore ilo oretitoi nebatata, neidak pooki te nebo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu nji nanu aatiaaka Olaitoriani, “Ore anaa enaikurrukur olng'atuny anaa olkuoo lo lng'atuny te ina ng'ues natara, naa te neipotuni olturrur loo lairritak meetu aarare ninye, nemeiture ninye nena buakunot enye aashu eirutie enkilepilep enye, neijia eikununye Olaitoriani te nedou alotu aitayu olarrabal te nchumata oldoinyo le Sion, o te shumata endoinyo enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore anaa enaitoip e motonyi, nkera enyena neijia eiko Olaitoriani loo lororani emitu Yerusalem; kerrip neitajeu ninye, kemitu nekordu ninye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embelekenyakinoto ilo apa litogolong'akitia oleng, lo tung'ana loo Siraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore kenya te ina olong, naa kenang'aa pooki ng'ae nena kitanyaanyukot enyena oo nkaitin e nkosholai, o nkitanyaanyukot e sahabu, apa naaitobirutua nkaik inyi too ng'ok, te nkaraki intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naa kebatata ile Asiria to lalem, leme olayioni le tung'ani; ore ilo alem leme olayioni le tung'ani neinos ninye; naa kelo ninye ailany ilo alem, ore elelero enye nepuoi aapik esinkaisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo oitaa ninye endapidapoi neisik to lkirutoto, ore lelo kituaak lenyena neilanyisho aaing'uaa inankan enye te nkiputukuny,” neijia ejo Olaitoriani otii enkima enye Sion netii olkokuet lenye atua Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
